{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104566","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104566/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104566/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104566/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104566","id":2944276408,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6P7Lut","number":104566,"title":"2d: Use dynamic buffers for instance data","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-24T19:36:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-19T09:17:01Z","closed_at":"2025-10-19T00:36:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104566","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104566.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104566.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"> [!IMPORTANT] \r\n>\r\n> Depends on \r\n>\r\n> - #103779\r\n\r\n# Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR updates the 2D canvas renderer to utilise dynamic buffers for instance data, per the changes in 7861cdde. \r\n\r\nI modified the Canvas 2D renderer to use dynamic buffers for the `InstanceData` (similar to what @darksylinc did for forward / mobile renderers). This change removes two copies, so the instance data is written once (on UMA devices):\r\n\r\n- one to upload the `InstanceData` to the GPU, and \r\n- a second to BLIT the instance data from the staging to the private GPU storage buffers. \r\n\r\nI modified the 1x1 sprite benchmark in @Calinou's [comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92797#pullrequestreview-2100153431), to draw 20,000 textured rectangles, which still batches, but reduces the CPU bottleneck of rendering 20,000 individual canvas items, to demonstrate the advantages of this PR. TileMaps is an example that will benefit from these changes. \r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Modified code</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\nconst ITERATIONS = 20_000\r\n\r\n@onready var spr: Sprite2D = $Sprite2D as Sprite2D\r\n\r\nvar draw_instances := false\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\t# Use fixed seed for reproducibility.\r\n\tseed(0x60d07)\r\n\r\n\tif draw_instances:\r\n\t\tfor i in ITERATIONS:\r\n\t\t\tvar sprite: Sprite2D\r\n\t\t\tsprite = spr.duplicate() as Sprite2D\r\n\t\t\tsprite.position.x = randf_range(0, 1152)\r\n\t\t\tsprite.position.y = randf_range(0, 648)\r\n\t\t\tadd_child(sprite)\r\n\r\nfunc _draw() -> void:\r\n\tif !draw_instances:\r\n\t\tvar tex: Texture2D = spr.texture\r\n\t\tvar pos: Vector2 = Vector2.ZERO\r\n\t\tfor i in ITERATIONS:\r\n\t\t\tpos.x = randf_range(0, 1152)\r\n\t\t\tpos.y = randf_range(0, 648)\r\n\t\t\tdraw_texture(tex, pos)\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nAbout a 10% improvement. The average FPS went from **3161 FPS** to **3487 FPS**","closed_by":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104566/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":8,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104566/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}